        "Content": "Rooneys are delighted to present this stunning three-bedroom detached residence, recently renovated to the highest standard and design. This exceptional home has been architecturally re-furbished to create a bright, spacious and tasteful accommodation, with a number of particularly distinctive original features throughout. Presented in absolutely turnkey condition, the property boasts a number of high quality appliances, fixtures, fittings and features and offers an impressive combination of contemporary living, thoughtful design and excellent outdoor space. A particularly striking architectural feature is the tasteful mix of original features and modern amenities, creating an incredible feel and atmosphere. \r\n\r\nOn entering the property, the guest is welcomed by a traditional half-door, entering into the hallway. Here, original stone work beautifully preserved, is exposed throughout the interior walls surrounding the new double glazed sash windows. New solid oak parquet floors add to the traditional décor with original light fittings. \r\n\r\nTo the left, the first living room boasts a solid fuel stove and southerly views, while the second living room to the right features an open fireplace and access to the rear. A guest bathroom can be found under the stair case with a W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen / living room is the heart of this magnificent home, with views and access to the rear. The new solid oak kitchen holds incredible storage space plus a number of unique features, such as;\r\n\r\nNew Range Oven\r\nPot Filler tap located above the hob\r\nFohen Boiling Water Tap\r\nHenley Solid Fuel Stove\r\nSolid Oak Parquet Floors\r\nBuilt in bench seating and pantry \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts three tasteful double bedrooms and a fully fitted bathroom. The primary bedroom features a full size bathtub and south facing windows. The two other double bedrooms feature south facing windows. The bathroom features a number of high quality fittings including a shower cubical, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, with the property enjoying the peace and privacy of a rural living while remaining exceptionally convenient to Limerick City Centre (10km) and Clonlara town \r\nWith its architecturally designed living accommodation, three bedrooms, exceptional open plan kitchen/living space, large private mature garden and outstanding turnkey condition, this is a truly special home. “Monaskeha” represents a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully\r\npresented, architecturally designed detached residence. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space, privacy and exceptional design this wonderful property has to offer.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\nCast Iron Radiators\r\nWater Supply from Private Well\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\nLarge Private Site\r\n10km to Limerick City\r\n1km to Clonlara\r\n\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Hall - 4.19m x 3.40m\r\nBeautiful mix of traditional stone work with modern fittings.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (2) - 4.02m x 3.06m\r\nBright and spacious front room with solid wood flooring, fireplace and built in alcoves\r\n\r\nLiving Room (1) - 4.13m x 3.61m\r\nDual aspect living room with open fire.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 5.02m x 4.47m\r\nExtensive new solid oak kitchen with boiling water tap, pot filler, exposed stone work, high ceilings and dual aspect views.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nW.C., W.H.B.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.50m x 3.37m\r\nBright front double room with solid wood flooring and a fitted bathtub.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.37m x 2.90m\r\nBright front facing double room with wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.43m x 2.35m\r\nBright front facing double room with wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.76m x 1.23m\r\nHigh quality shower unit, W.C., W.H.B.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\nThese Particulars and Terms are issued by Rooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited on the agreed understanding that all negotiations in respect of the property mentioned, are and will be conducted through them. Whilst every care has been taken in preparing these Particulars and Terms of the said property, Rooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited do not warrant these Particulars and Terms or any representations made by them about the property and all intending purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness and/or accuracy of the information given. Rooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited shall further not be liable for any loss or expenses, which may be incurred in visiting the property, should it prove unsuitable or to have been let, sold or withdrawn."
